{%- comment -%}
  Strona /pages/track-order (06.10.2026). Wczesniej byla pusta ("Track your order" bez
  formularza), a linkuja do niej stopka, polityka dostawy i FAQ. Bez aplikacji do sledzenia:
  prowadzi do konta klienta (Shopify pokazuje tam status i sledzenie) i do maila z wysylki.
  Styl z sn-polityki (.snp).
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="snp">
  <div class="snp__head">
    <p class="snp__eyebrow">Help</p>
    <h2 class="snp__title">Track your order</h2>
    <p class="snp__lead">How to see where your parcel is – and what to do if it doesn't show up.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__facts">
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">Free</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">shipping on every order</span></div>
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">3–4</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">business days to dispatch</span></div>
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">3–6</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">business days in transit</span></div>
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">Tracking</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">on every parcel</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">01</span>Find your parcel</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <ol class="snp__steps">
        <li><strong>Check your inbox.</strong> Once your order ships, you get an email with your tracking number and a link to follow the parcel.</li>
        <li><strong>Or log in to your account.</strong> Use the email you ordered with – we'll send you a code, and under the order you can see its status and tracking.</li>
        <li><strong>No email?</strong> Check your spam or promotions folder before you write to us.</li>
      </ol>
      <a class="snp__btn" href="{{ routes.account_url }}">Log in and view your order</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">02</span>Several parcels for one order</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>Items aren't always stocked in the same place, so one order can arrive in several parcels, each with its own tracking number. You don't pay extra for that.</p>
      <div class="snp__note"><p>If the last parcel hasn't arrived within a week of the first, write to us and we'll chase it up.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__help">
    <p class="snp__help-title">Can't find your order?</p>
    <p>Send us your order number and we'll find it for you.</p>
    <a class="snp__btn" href="/pages/contact">Contact us</a>
    <p class="snp__help-meta">kontakt@stilhusetnord.dk · Mon–Fri 9:00–18:00 CET · reply within 1–2 business days</p>
  </div>
</div>
